  "verification": "Reference implementation: reference/routing/route.ts — createRouteProposal, routeProposalSigningPayload, verifySignature (reference/identity/keys.ts).",
  "notes": "Per spec/07 §5.1: the signature is over the canonical proposal payload only — never over a caller-chosen routeId. Mutating any field of the proposal (hops[].nodeId, requirementDigest, expiry, initiatorNodeId, agreementDigest) invalidates the signature."
